# Files excluded from Vercel upload (CLI deploys; Git deploys rely on the
# /docs, /supabase and /tools redirects in vercel.json, which run before the
# filesystem and therefore block those paths for every deployment type).
# tools/ is deliberately NOT listed here: it is the Build Command
# (node tools/make-env.vercel.js) and must exist during build.
.env
.env.local
AUDIT_REPORT.md
docs/
supabase/
*.log
